---
layout: default
page_class: homepage
title: Home
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Software Architect &amp; Author</span>
    <h1>AI-Powered SaaS That Holds Up at Scale</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Lee Atchison is a software architect and author who helps companies architect and operate AI-powered SaaS at scale.</p>
    <p class="hero-desc">Adding AI to a product is the easy part. Keeping it fast, affordable and reliable once real customers arrive is where most teams get stuck.</p>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Work with Lee</a>
      <a href="https://softwarearchitectureinsights.com" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the Newsletter</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%
  spotlight_books   = site.collections["books"].resources
                        .select { |b| b.data.spotlight_leeatchison }
                        .sort_by { |b| b.data.order_leeatchison || 99 }
  spotlight_courses = site.collections["courses"].resources
                        .select { |c| c.data.spotlight_leeatchison }
                        .sort_by { |c| c.data.order_leeatchison || 99 }

  featured_courses  = site.collections["courses"].resources
                        .select { |c| c.data.feature_leeatchison }
                        .sort_by { |c| c.data.order_leeatchison || 99 }

  featured_books    = site.collections["books"].resources
                        .select { |b| b.data.feature_leeatchison }
                        .sort_by { |b| b.data.order_leeatchison || 99 }
%>

<% unless spotlight_books.empty? && spotlight_courses.empty? %>
<section class="whats-new">
  <div class="whats-new-inner">
    <div class="whats-new-header">
      <span class="section-label">What's New</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">What's New from Lee</h2>
    </div>
    <% spotlight_books.each do |book| %>
      <article class="book-card">
        <div class="book-cover-wrap">
          <img src="<%= relative_url book.data.cover_image %>"
               alt="<%= book.data.title %> book cover" class="book-cover" />
        </div>
        <div class="book-card-body">
          <% if book.data.badge %>
            <span class="book-tag book-tag--<%= book.data.badge_style || 'new' %>"><%= book.data.badge %></span>
          <% end %>
          <h3><%= book.data.title %></h3>
          <p class="book-authors"><%= book.data.authors.join(", ") %></p>
          <p><%= book.data.summary %></p>
          <a href="<%= relative_url book.relative_url %>" class="book-link">Learn more &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    <% end %>
    <div class="whats-new-content">
      <div class="home-courses-grid">
        <% spotlight_courses.each do |course| %>
          <a href="<%= relative_url course.relative_url %>" class="course-card">
            <% if course.data.cover_image %>
              <div class="course-cover-wrap">
                <img src="<%= relative_url course.data.cover_image %>"
                     alt="<%= course.data.title %> course image" class="course-cover" />
              </div>
            <% end %>
            <% if course.data.availability == "prelaunch" %>
              <span class="course-card-platform course-platform-badge--prelaunch">Coming Soon</span>
            <% else %>
              <span class="course-card-platform"><%= course.data.platform %></span>
            <% end %>
            <h3><%= course.data.title %></h3>
            <p><%= course.data.summary %></p>
            <span class="course-card-link">Learn more &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<% end %>

<section class="pillars" id="topics">
  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-label">What Lee Works On</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Four Problems Lee Helps Solve</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="pillars-grid">
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-icon-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M20 9h3M20 14h3M1 9h3M1 14h3"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Architecting AI-powered SaaS at scale</h3>
      <p>Most AI features start bolted onto the side of the app. That works for a demo. At scale, the model needs a real place in the architecture.</p>
      <a href="<%= relative_url '/ainative' %>" class="pillar-link">The five levels of AI-native architecture &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-icon-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 1v22"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>AI cost architecture</h3>
      <p>A function call used to be free. A model call isn&rsquo;t, and the bill grows with every customer. Cost has to be part of the design, because the invoice is a bad place to find out.</p>
      <a href="https://softwarearchitectureinsights.com/posts/your-function-call-was-free/" class="pillar-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Your Function Call Was Free. This One Isn&rsquo;t. &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-icon-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Operating AI reliably in production</h3>
      <p>An AI feature can be up and still be wrong. Reliability now means knowing how often it&rsquo;s wrong, who it affects, and how fast you&rsquo;ll notice.</p>
      <a href="https://softwarearchitectureinsights.com/posts/ai-didnt-break-your-risk-matrix/" class="pillar-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI Didn&rsquo;t Break Your Risk Matrix. It Broke Your Scores. &rarr;</a>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar-card">
      <div class="pillar-icon-wrap">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Scalability and high availability</h3>
      <p>Your system worked fine at a thousand users. Then it didn&rsquo;t. Lee has done this work since Amazon, and wrote the O&rsquo;Reilly book on it.</p>
      <a href="https://architectingforscale.com" class="pillar-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Architecting for Scale &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="about-photo-block">
      <div class="about-photo-circle">
        <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/lee-atchison.png' %>" alt="Lee Atchison" />
      </div>
      <div class="about-credentials">
        <span class="credential-badge">Software Architect</span>
        <span class="credential-badge">Author</span>
        <span class="credential-badge">Former AI Company CTO</span>
        <span class="credential-badge">Advisor</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-text">
      <span class="section-label">About Lee</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">From Amazon and New Relic to AI</h2>
      <p>Lee Atchison is a software architect and author who helps companies architect and operate AI-powered SaaS at scale. At Amazon, he helped rearchitect the retail website and built AWS Elastic Beanstalk. He led architecture for New Relic&rsquo;s fast-growing SaaS platform and served as CTO of an AI company. He wrote <em>Architecting for Scale</em> (O&rsquo;Reilly) and publishes Software Architecture Insights.</p>
      <p><a href="<%= relative_url '/about' %>" class="book-link">More about Lee &rarr;</a></p>
      <div class="about-companies">
        <span class="company-tag">Amazon.com</span>
        <span class="company-tag">AWS</span>
        <span class="company-tag">New Relic</span>
        <span class="company-tag">Product Genius</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="books" id="books">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-label">Published Works</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Books by Lee Atchison</h2>
      <p>Practical guides for architects and technology leaders navigating modern software challenges.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="books-grid">
      <% featured_books.each do |book| %>
        <article class="book-card">
          <a href="<%= relative_url book.relative_url %>" class="book-card-link-wrap">
            <div class="book-cover-wrap">
              <img src="<%= relative_url book.data.cover_image %>"
                   alt="<%= book.data.title %> book cover" class="book-cover" />
            </div>
          </a>
          <div class="book-card-body">
            <% if book.data.badge %>
              <span class="book-tag book-tag--<%= book.data.badge_style || 'new' %>"><%= book.data.badge %></span>
            <% end %>
            <h3><a href="<%= relative_url book.relative_url %>"><%= book.data.title %></a></h3>
            <% if book.data.authors %>
              <p class="book-authors"><%= book.data.authors.join(", ") %></p>
            <% end %>
            <p><%= book.data.summary %></p>
            <div class="book-card-actions">
              <a href="<%= relative_url book.relative_url %>" class="book-link">Details &rarr;</a>
              <% if book.data.book_url %>
                <a href="<%= book.data.book_url %>" class="book-link book-link--amazon"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit the book site</a>
              <% elsif book.data.amazon_url %>
                <a href="<%= book.data.amazon_url %>" class="book-link book-link--amazon"
                   target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Amazon</a>
              <% end %>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      <% end %>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center; margin-top:2.5rem;">
      <a href="<%= relative_url '/books' %>" class="btn btn-outline btn-outline--dark">View All Books &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="courses" id="courses">
  <div class="courses-inner">
    <div class="courses-stat">
      <div class="stat-card">
        <span class="stat-number">180,000+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">learners have taken Lee&rsquo;s courses</span>
        <div class="stat-divider"></div>
        <p class="stat-desc">Professionals across the globe learn cloud architecture, scalability, and modern software design from Lee&rsquo;s courses.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="courses-content">
      <span class="section-label">Training &amp; Education</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Learn from a Master Architect</h2>
      <p class="courses-desc">Lee&rsquo;s courses reach professionals across the globe through leading learning platforms, covering software architecture, cloud computing, and more.</p>
      <div class="home-courses-grid">
        <% featured_courses.each do |course| %>
          <a href="<%= relative_url course.relative_url %>" class="course-card">
            <% if course.data.cover_image %>
              <div class="course-cover-wrap">
                <img src="<%= relative_url course.data.cover_image %>"
                     alt="<%= course.data.title %> course image" class="course-cover" />
              </div>
            <% end %>
            <% if course.data.availability == "prelaunch" %>
              <span class="course-card-platform course-platform-badge--prelaunch">Coming Soon</span>
            <% else %>
              <span class="course-card-platform"><%= course.data.platform %></span>
            <% end %>
            <h3><%= course.data.title %></h3>
            <p><%= course.data.summary %></p>
            <span class="course-card-link">Learn more &rarr;</span>
          </a>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-group ain-btn-group-left">
        <a href="<%= relative_url '/courses' %>" class="btn btn-outline btn-outline--dark">View All Courses &rarr;</a>
        <a href="https://atchisonacademy.com" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the Academy &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="insights" id="insights">
  <div class="section-inner insights-inner">
    <div class="insights-logo">
      <img src="<%= relative_url '/images/sai-logo.png' %>" alt="Software Architecture Insights" />
    </div>
    <span class="section-label">Knowledge Hub</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Software Architecture Insights</h2>
    <p class="insights-desc">Lee&rsquo;s weekly newsletter and podcast on building AI into SaaS, what it costs to run, keeping it reliable, and designing for scale.</p>
    <div class="insights-topics">
      <a href="<%= relative_url '/ainative' %>" class="topic-tag topic-tag--link">AI-Native</a>
      <span class="topic-tag">AI Cost</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">AI Reliability</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">Scalability</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">High Availability</span>
      <span class="topic-tag">Tech Leadership</span>
    </div>
    <a href="https://softwarearchitectureinsights.com" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the Article Library</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="contact-inner">
    <div class="contact-text">
      <span class="section-label">Work with Lee</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Let&rsquo;s Look at Your Architecture</h2>
      <p class="contact-intro">Usually something ran fine until it didn&rsquo;t, or an AI feature is about to ship. Either way, the earlier we talk, the cheaper the fix.</p>
      <ul class="services-list">
        <li>Architecture reviews for AI-powered SaaS platforms</li>
        <li>AI cost and reliability assessments</li>
        <li>Scalability and availability reviews</li>
        <li>Fractional chief architect and advisory roles</li>
      </ul>
      <a href="<%= relative_url '/contact' %>" class="btn btn-primary contact-cta">Talk With Lee</a>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-methods">
      <a href="<%= relative_url '/contact' %>" class="contact-method">
        <div class="contact-method-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>Send a Message</strong>
          <span>Use the contact form to reach Lee</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/leeatchison" class="contact-method">
        <div class="contact-method-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect x="2" y="9" width="4" height="12"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <strong>LinkedIn</strong>
          <span>Connect and message on LinkedIn</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>